# Text files are LF in the working tree as well as in the repository. Several
# tests read server.js and match on "\n", and a global core.autocrlf=true on
# Windows rewrote files as CRLF on every checkout, which failed six tests that
# had nothing wrong with them.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff2 binary
